		"hu": {
			"subject": "Emlékeztető: ellenőrizd a szabadságaidat ({{periodLabel}})",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Emlékeztető: havi szabadság-ellenőrzés</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Emlékeztető: havi szabadság-ellenőrzés</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Kedves {{recipientNameHtml}}!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">A(z) <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> szervezetben még nem válaszoltál a havi szabadság-összesítőre ({{periodLabel}}). {{reminderNoticeHtml}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Rögzített szabadság – {{periodLabel}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{itemsHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Ha minden stimmel, fogadd el az irányítópulton. Ha valami hiányzik, fölösleges vagy rossz típussal szerepel, ott jelezheted az eltérést.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Ellenőrzés megnyitása</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">Ezt az emailt azért kaptad, mert a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben válaszra vár a havi szabadság-ellenőrzésed.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Kedves {{recipientName}}!\n\nA(z) {{organizationName}} szervezetben még nem válaszoltál a havi szabadság-összesítőre ({{periodLabel}}). {{reminderNoticeText}}\n\nRögzített szabadság – {{periodLabel}}:\n{{itemsText}}\n\nHa minden stimmel, fogadd el az irányítópulton. Ha valami hiányzik, fölösleges vagy rossz típussal szerepel, ott jelezheted az eltérést: {{appUrl}}\n\nEzt az emailt azért kaptad, mert a(z) {{appName}} rendszerben válaszra vár a havi szabadság-ellenőrzésed.\n\n{{appName}}"
		},
		"en": {
			"subject": "Reminder: please check your leave ({{periodLabel}})",
			"html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n\t<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\t<title>Reminder: monthly leave check</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f4f4f5;\">\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 48px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"max-width: 520px; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 32px 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #3b82f6;\">{{appNameHtml}}</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 0 32px 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #18181b; text-align: center;\">Reminder: monthly leave check</h1>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">Dear {{recipientNameHtml}},</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">You have not answered the monthly leave summary of <strong>{{organizationNameHtml}}</strong> yet ({{periodLabel}}). {{reminderNoticeHtml}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background-color: #f9fafb; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 16px 20px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: #52525b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em;\">Recorded leave – {{periodLabel}}</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t{{itemsHtml}}\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6; color: #52525b;\">If everything is correct, accept it on the dashboard. If something is missing, extra or recorded with the wrong type, you can report it there.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<td align=\"center\" style=\"padding: 0 0 8px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"{{appUrl}}\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 24px; background-color: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 500; font-size: 14px;\">Open the check</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<td style=\"padding: 24px 32px; border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e7;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #a1a1aa; text-align: center;\">You received this email because your monthly leave check is waiting for your answer in {{appName}}.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t\t\t\t</tr>\n\t\t\t\t</table>\n\t\t\t</td>\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</table>\n</body>\n</html>",
			"text": "Dear {{recipientName}},\n\nYou have not answered the monthly leave summary of {{organizationName}} yet ({{periodLabel}}). {{reminderNoticeText}}\n\nRecorded leave – {{periodLabel}}:\n{{itemsText}}\n\nIf everything is correct, accept it on the dashboard. If something is missing, extra or recorded with the wrong type, you can report it there: {{appUrl}}\n\nYou received this email because your monthly leave check is waiting for your answer in {{appName}}.\n\n{{appName}}"
		}
	}
}
